# A quick key cycle (plan 6 Task 10, design §7.4): ign98_pl and ign98_is on at idle; the key goes off at 12.5 s and back
# on 3 s later in the after-run, so the ECU keeps its RAM; the overlay has switched both off at the engine's stop, and
# the restart runs on the flashed maps until the app switches them on again.
drive quick-key-cycle
start blank
set coolant=90 oil=90 intake=33 ambient=20 clock=60   # a warm engine, the clock at 01:00
3 on
kline connect                  # the MS43 logger app: connected at the key-on (125,000 baud), polling the live frame,
kline poll                     # and a 0x6D status every second, the keep-alive the overlay needs (plan 6 contract)
kline every 1 6D 00
kline send 6D 01 00 00 00      # load ign98_pl at 0
kline send 6D 01 01 01 40      # load ign98_is at 320
1.5 crank rpm=200
3 idle
kline send 6D 03 00 00 00      # on, edit sum 0
kline send 6D 03 01 00 00
5 idle
3 off
3 crank rpm=200
3 idle
kline send 6D 03 00 00 00      # on, edit sum 0
kline send 6D 03 01 00 00
3 idle
